        <div class="jcBand">
            <div id="pnlJobDescription">
	
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #333333; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial;">Please see the attached duty statement for details on this postion.<br /><br /> </span></span><span style="line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #333333;">Candidate may be selected by resume review.</span><br /><br /></span><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><strong>Hires may be made in the following counties: Calaveras, Fresno, Kern, Kings, Los Angeles, Madera, Mariposa, Merced,&nbsp;Monterey, Riverside, San Benito, San Diego, </strong><strong>Sa</strong><strong>n Luis Obispo, Santa Barbara, Stanislaus, Tuolumne, Ventura and San Bernardino.&nbsp;</strong><br /><span style="font-family: Arial;"><br />These positions&nbsp;are being filled Limited Term up to 24 months with the possibility of becoming Permanent.</span><strong><br /><br /></strong></span></span></span><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt;"><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Applications will be processed in rounds with the following cut-off dates:</span></p><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">December 9, 2024</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">January&nbsp;9,&nbsp; 2025</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">February&nbsp; &nbsp;7,&nbsp; 2025</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">March&nbsp; 10,&nbsp; 2025</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">April&nbsp; 9,&nbsp; 2025</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">May&nbsp; 9,&nbsp; 2025</span></li></ul><p>You will find additional information about the job in the <strong><a href='https://www.CalCareers.ca.gov/CalHrPublic/FileDownload.aspx?aid=26507801&name=CommOpps199(1).pdf' target='_blank'>Duty Statement</a></strong>.</p>
                </p>
            
</div>

            <div id="pnlWorkingConditions">
	
                <h3 class="postingHeader">Working Conditions</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #333333;">Successfully completes required training as a condition of employment. The incumbent must pass background and medical clearance prior to appointment. Will be subject to working nights, weekends and holidays to complete duties. </span><br /></span><br />
                </p>
            
</div>
        </div>

